cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use zjs in research or published software, cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "zjs: An Embeddable JavaScript Engine Written in Zig"
abstract: >-
  zjs is an embeddable JavaScript engine written in Zig and a semantic and
  mechanism-level rewrite of Bellard QuickJS. It exposes a Zig-native API for
  running JavaScript inside trusted Zig applications.
authors:
  - name: "zjs contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aneryu/zjs"
url: "https://github.com/aneryu/zjs"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - JavaScript
  - ECMAScript
  - Zig
  - QuickJS
  - embeddable JavaScript engine
  - bytecode interpreter
